OL,3,ATV's biggest stars to walk red carpet
OL,4,Aahead of 78th Emmy Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay is
OL,7,Fset to host TV's biggest night, the
OL,8,F78th Primetime Emmy Awards
OL,10,FStars will soon begin arriving to walk
OL,11,Fthe red carpet at the Peacock Theater
OL,12,Fin Downtown Los Angeles - the awards
OL,13,Fshow kicks off at 17:00 local time
OL,14,F(20:00 EDT/01:00 BST)
OL,16,FLeading the pack in nominations this
OL,17,Fyear is the medical drama The Pitt,
OL,18,Fwhich is up for 25 awards - read more
OL,19,Fabout the show here
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
